---

## Status Notice

This document represents the initial synthesis of the Human Capability Quotient Map. It is undergoing formal literature review and will be revised for v1.0 publication with full scholarly citations. Concepts are drawn from existing research in psychology, cognitive science, and intelligence research; formal attribution to source literature will appear in v1.0.

This v0.1 working version is published for transparency and to establish the project development timeline. It should not yet be treated as a finished scholarly work.

